rgins. [Create your store on Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Brooke Cagle](https://unsplash.com/photos/N_Yv9x5e7vQ) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(693,'## Delivering Beyond Kathmandu Valley\n\nWhile Kathmandu Valley represents a large concentration of digital spenders, the fastest-growing e-commerce markets in Nepal are regional economic hubs: **Pokhara, Butwal, Biratnagar, Narayangarh, Itahari, Hetauda, Nepalgunj, and Dhangadhi**.\n\nExpanding nationwide shipping unlocks 4x more potential buyers for your products.\n\n---\n\n### Geographic Shipping Tiers in Nepal\n\n```\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| TIER 1: Kathmandu Valley (KTM, Lalitpur, Bhaktapur) - 24 Hrs      |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| TIER 2: Major Highway Cities (Pokhara, Butwal, Biratnagar) - 48h  |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| TIER 3: Terai & Mid-Hill District HQs (Surkhet, Dang, Ilam) - 72h |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| TIER 4: Mountain & Remote Districts (Jumla, Mustang, Bajura) - 5d |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n---\n\n### Setting Dynamic Shipping Rules in Sazilo Store\n\nIn your Sazilo Store admin dashboard:\n1. Go to **Settings > Shipping Zones**.\n2. Create **Zone 1 (Valley Express)**: Flat Rs. 100 (Free for orders over Rs. 2,500).\n3. Create **Zone 2 (Major Cities)**: Flat Rs. 180 (Free for orders over Rs. 4,000).\n4. Create **Zone 3 (Remote Districts)**: Flat Rs. 280 with mandatory advance shipping confirmation.\n\nShip nationwide with confidence. [Start your store on Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Raimond Klavins](https://unsplash.com/photos/u4g7F7e