 Clearly printed cash collection amount (e.g., `COD: Rs. 2,450`) to avoid under-collection errors.\n\nStreamline your shipping operations. [Launch your store on Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Brooke Cagle](https://unsplash.com/photos/N_Yv9x5e7vQ) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(698,'## Say Goodbye to Handwritten Parcel Slips\n\nMany small e-commerce sellers in Nepal still write customer names, phone numbers, and COD amounts by hand with a marker pen on cardboard boxes. This causes major issues:\n- Illegible handwriting leads courier riders to dial wrong phone numbers.\n- Smudged ink during rain ruins destination addresses.\n- Hand-writing 50 boxes takes 2 hours of valuable staff time every single day.\n\n---\n\n### Sazilo Store Automated Shipping Label Engine\n\nWith **Sazilo Store**, you can print professional **4x6 inch thermal shipping labels** or standard A4 sheet stickers in 1 click.\n\n#### What\'s Included on Every Sazilo Store Shipping Label:\n1. **Bold Recipient Details**: Customer Name, Verified Mobile Number, Landmark, and District.\n2. **Merchant Branding**: Your Store Name, Contact Hotline, and Sender Address.\n3. **Scannable Order Barcode (Code128)**: Courier dispatch teams can scan the parcel instantly into their tracking system.\n4. **Prominent COD Cash Tag**: Clearly printed cash collection amount (e.g., `COD: Rs. 2,450`) to avoid under-collection errors.\n\nStreamline your shipping operations. [Launch your store on Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Brooke Cagle](https://unsplash.com/photos/N_Yv9x5e7vQ) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(699,'## The Instagram DM Bottleneck in Nepal\n\nInstagram is an incredible visual channel for Nepali fashion 