st Indexing\nGoogle ranks fast, responsive mobile websites higher. Sazilo Store stores are optimized for perfect Google Lighthouse scores, minimal JavaScript bloat, and fast Core Web Vitals.\n\nDominate Google rankings with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Roberto Cortese](https://unsplash.com/photos/l5A0612jSJY) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(706,'## Why Search Engine Optimization Matters in Nepal\n\nWhen Nepali consumers decide to buy an item—whether it is *\'buy winter puffer jacket in Kathmandu\'*, *\'best organic tea Nepal\'*, or *\'online shoe shopping Nepal\'*, their first instinct is to search on Google.\n\nRanking on the first page for these commercial search terms generates consistent, highly qualified buyer traffic without paying a single rupee in advertising fees.\n\n---\n\n### The 4 Pillars of E-Commerce SEO in Nepal\n\n#### 1. High-Intent Localized Keyword Strategy\nInclude city and local context in your product titles:\n- *Good*: \"Men\'s Black Leather Jacket\"\n- *Superior*: \"Genuine Men\'s Black Leather Jacket in Nepal (Free Delivery Kathmandu & Pokhara)\"\n\n#### 2. Structured Product Schema Markup\n**Sazilo Store** automatically outputs Google-compliant JSON-LD structured data on every product page:\n- Product Name & High-Res Image URLs\n- Real-time Price in NPR (`\"priceCurrency\": \"NPR\"`)\n- Availability Status (`\"InStock\"`)\n- Merchant Star Ratings & Reviews\n\nThis enables rich snippet results on Google searches with star ratings and pricing previews.\n\n#### 3. Core Web Vitals & Mobile-First Indexing\nGoogle ranks fast, responsive mobile websites higher. Sazilo Store stores are optimized for perfect Google Lighthouse scores, minimal JavaScript bloat, and fast Core Web Vitals.\n\nDominate Google rankings with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Roberto Cortese](https://unsplash.com/photos/l5A0612jSJY) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(707,'## The Power of Local Micro-Influencers in Nepal\n\nIn Nepal\'s close-knit social culture, recommendations from trusted lifestyle creators and niche micro-influencers carry immense weight. Collaborating with creators who genuinely love your products is one of the fastest ways to build brand credibility.\n\n---\n\n### Why Micro-Influencers (10K to 50K Followers) Outperform Celebrities\n\n1. **Higher Engagement Rates**: Micro-influencers interact directly in comment sections and build strong personal bonds with their followers.\n2. **Cost-Effective Collaboration**: Many micro-creators are happy to review products in exchange for free merchandise gifting (barter) or modest sponsorship fees (Rs. 5,000 to Rs. 15,000 per Reel).\n3. **Niche Audience Targeting**: Whether your product is gym supplements, modest ethnic wear, or tech gadgets, you can find influencers whose audience matches your exact buyer profile.\n\n---\n\n### Step-by-Step Influencer Campaign Workflow\n\n1. **Identify Relevant Creators**: Search Instagram and TikTok for creators actively posting about your niche in Kathmandu, Pokhara, or Chitwan.\n2. **Send a Personalized DM / Email**: Propose a collaboration with clear deliverables (e.g., 1 Instagram Reel + 2 Stories with link stickers).\n3. **Generate Custom Promo Codes**: Create a unique discount code in your Sazilo Store dashboard (e.g., `PRIYA10` for 10% off) to track exact sales generated by each creator.\n4. **Repurpose Creator Videos as Ads**: Whitelist top-performing creator content to run as high-converting Meta Ads.\n\nScale your influencer marketing with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Aiony Haust](https://unsplash.com/photos/3TLl_97HNJo) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm