shiers do not need to reach for a mouse during transactions:\n- **`F2`**: Opens the instant fuzzy search modal. Type \'Black XL\' to immediately find matching apparel.\n- **`F4`**: Applies custom line-item or whole-cart percentage discounts.\n- **`F9`**: Triggers one-touch instant payment confirmation and auto-prints the 58mm or 80mm thermal receipt slip.\n\n---\n\n### Comparison: Legacy Offline Software vs Sazilo Store Cloud POS\n\n| Feature | Outdated Local POS Software | Sazilo Store Cloud POS |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Hardware Compatibility** | Locked to specific Windows desktop | **Runs on PC, Mac, iPad, Android, Tablet** |\n| **Real-Time Online Sync** | No online sync or complex nightly batch | **Instant real-time omnichannel sync** |\n| **Barcode Generation** | Needs external 3rd-party software | **Built-in Code128 Barcode Studio** |\n| **Cloud Backups** | High risk of hard-drive corruption | **Automated real-time cloud backup** |\n| **Cost** | Rs. 25,000 upfront + Annual AMCs | **Included free with Sazilo Store** |\n\n---\n\n### Hardware Setup in 3 Simple Steps\n\n1. Connect your standard USB barcode scanner to your counter laptop.\n2. Connect your 58mm or 80mm thermal POS receipt printer (ESC/POS compatible).\n3. Open `yourstore.sazilostore.com/pos` in Google Chrome and start billing immediately.\n\nUpgrade your retail counter today. [Start using Sazilo Store POS](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Christiann Koepke](https://unsplash.com/photos/4W4WvOgT_3c) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(712,'## The Need for Speed at the Retail Counter\n\nWhether you operate a bustling clothing store in New Road, an electronics counter in Mahabouddha, or an organic health outlet in Jhamsikhel, customer checkout speed directly impacts store revenue and customer satisfaction.\n\nLegacy POS software in Nepal is often slow, crashes on