ht **1-Year Official Replacement Warranty** and **100% Genuine Certified** badges prominently on your Sazilo Store storefront.\n2. **Serial & IMEI Number Logging**: Record device serial numbers directly on customer invoices at the POS counter to simplify warranty verification.\n3. **Smart Accessory Bundling**: Bundle phone cases, 9H tempered glass screen protectors, and 20W fast chargers with new smartphone purchases for a single discounted price.\n\nGrow your electronics business with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Roberto Cortese](https://unsplash.com/photos/l5A0612jSJY) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(729,'## Preserving Nepal\'s Rich Artisanal Heritage\n\nNepal\'s artistic craftsmanship is legendary: intricate Thangka scroll paintings with 24-karat gold dust, hand-carved Newari wooden windows, Singing Bowls tuned to specific chakras, and handwoven Palpali Dhaka textiles.\n\nHistorically, artisans in Patan, Bhaktapur, and Palpa sold their work to tourist curio dealers for a small fraction of the final price. With **Sazilo Store**, artisan guilds and craft workshops can establish direct-to-consumer storefronts.\n\n---\n\n### Essentials for Selling Handicrafts Online\n\n1. **Certificate of Authenticity**: Provide digital certificates of master craftsmanship signed by the artist.\n2. **Detailed Artisan Profiles**: Tell the human story behind each piece—who made it, how many weeks of carving were involved, and the cultural symbolism.\n3. **High-Ticket Safe Courier Packing**: Sazilo Store integrates with specialized export freight forwarders for secure global delivery.\n\nShowcase your crafts to the world with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Bimal KC](https://unsplash.com/photos/3kPj-Hn6_7E) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&