vents in-transit breakage.\n2. **Usage & Seasoning Care Guides**: Educate urban buyers on how to season traditional unglazed clay cookware (Curd Matkas, Biryani Pots) before first use.\n3. **Curated Home Decor Sets**: Bundle 3 ceramic plant pots of varying sizes as a unified balcony gardening kit.\n\nLaunch your pottery studio online with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Bimal KC](https://unsplash.com/photos/3kPj-Hn6_7E) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(732,'## Bringing Bhaktapur Pottery Square to Modern Homes\n\nFor generations, the Prajapati potters of Bhaktapur have spun wheel clay to create traditional water pots (Ghyampo), yogurt cups (Juju Dhau matkas), and oil lamps (Pala).\n\nToday, modern ceramic studios and traditional potters are reaching urban homes in Kathmandu, Pokhara, and Chitwan who desire organic, handmade clay kitchenware, decorative indoor planters, and ceramic tableware.\n\n---\n\n### E-Commerce Blueprint for Clay & Ceramic Studios\n\n1. **Safe Transit Packaging**: Cushioning ceramic pieces with multi-layer bubble wrap and custom-fit cardboard partitions prevents in-transit breakage.\n2. **Usage & Seasoning Care Guides**: Educate urban buyers on how to season traditional unglazed clay cookware (Curd Matkas, Biryani Pots) before first use.\n3. **Curated Home Decor Sets**: Bundle 3 ceramic plant pots of varying sizes as a unified balcony gardening kit.\n\nLaunch your pottery studio online with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Bimal KC](https://unsplash.com/photos/3kPj-Hn6_7E) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(733,'## The Rise of Clean Beauty in Nepal\n\nNepali consumers are becoming deeply conscious of the ingredients they apply to their skin