on to add pre-stitched falls and pico service |\n| **Semi-Stitched Lehengas** | Velvet, Net with Zari embroidery | Waist (up to 42 in), Flare (Gher 3.5m+), Height | Upload unstitched fabric video clips under natural light |\n| **Everyday Co-ord Sets** | Linen, Korean Cotton, Rayon | Top Length, Pants Inseam, Elasticated Waist | Include model height and wearing size reference |\n\n---\n\n### Setting Up Multi-Tier Sizing Matrices on Sazilo Store\n\nWith the **Sazilo Store** variant engine, you can define multi-dimensional attributes without cluttering your product catalog:\n\n1. **Standard Sizes**: Small (36\"), Medium (38\"), Large (40\"), XL (42\"), and XXL (44\").\n2. **Custom Stitching Add-On**: Allow buyers to enter exact tailor measurements (Chest, Waist, Blouse Length, Sleeve Fit) directly in checkout notes.\n3. **Colorways with Live Swatches**: Showcase authentic fabric colors under studio lighting so customers receive exact shades.\n\n---\n\n### High-Converting Packaging and Nationwide Delivery\n\n- **Packaging**: Wrap delicate embroideries in moisture-resistant acid-free butter paper, followed by a branded ziplock pouch and sturdy carton to prevent crushing during transit.\n- **Logistics**: Integrate with local courier networks (Pathao, Nepal Can Move, Gaau Gharka) to provide 24-hour delivery inside Kathmandu Valley and 2-4 day express shipping to 77 districts across Nepal.\n\nStart your high-converting online fashion boutique with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Nimish Gogri](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(804,'## The Booming Ethnic and Modern Women\'s Fashion Market in Nepal\n\nWomen\'s fashion is one of the highest-volume e-commerce sectors in Nepal. From traditional handloom Dhaka kurthas, Banarasi silk sarees, and bridal lehengas to modern everyday workwear