together.\n- *65W GaN Charger + 100W Braided USB-C Cable*: 15% bundle discount.\n- *Smartwatch + Extra 3-Pack Ocean Loop Straps*: Free screen guard included.\n\n---\n\n### Barcode Scanning at the New Road Counter\n\nWhen a customer walks into your New Road shop, scan the product barcode using Sazilo Store Cloud POS (<15ms response). Hit **F9** to trigger an instant Fonepay dynamic QR on the counter screen. Both in-store and online inventories stay synchronized in real time.\n\nDigitize your gadget store with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Ashim DSilva](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(811,'## Digitizing Nepal\'s Heritage Jewelers\n\nGold and silver (Sun-Chandi) hold profound cultural, religious, and financial value in Nepali households. From Laxmi Puja Dhanteras silver coins and bridal bridal set ornaments to minimalist 925 sterling silver daily jewelry, demand is shifting toward verified, certified online channels.\n\nSelling precious metals online requires stringent security protocols, daily bullion rate adjustments adhering to the Federation of Nepal Gold and Silver Dealers\' Association (FENEGOSIDA), and tamper-evident fulfillment.\n\n---\n\n### Managing Dynamic Bullion Pricing in Nepal\n\n| Metal Type | Standard Purity | Pricing Basis | Required Customer Certificate |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Fine Gold (Chhapa Mar)** | 24 Karat (99.9% pure) | Live FENEGOSIDA per tola rate + Making Charge | Bureau of Standards Assay Hallmark Certificate |\n| **Tejabi Gold** | 22 Karat (91.6% pure) | Daily tola benchmark rate | Karat Purity Test Card |\n| **Fine Silver Bullion** | 999 Fine Silver | Live per 10g / tola rate | Mint Authenticity Guarantee Seal |\n| **925 Sterling Silver Jewelry** | 92.5% pure silver + alloy | Fixed design price with stone setting | 925 Hallmark Laser Stamp |\n\n---\n\n### Secure Logistics and Tamper-Proof Fulfillment\n\nHigh-value jewelry cannot be shipped in ordinary courier bags. Implement these safety measures:\n1. **Tamper-Evident Security Seals**: Use sequential serialized security tape that reveals a \'VOID\' watermark if peeled or cut.\n2. **Direct Handover with OTP**: The delivery rider must verify the recipient\'s government ID and enter a one-time SMS verification code before handing over the parcel.\n3. **Transit Insurance**: Partner with courier providers offering full value transit insurance coverage for precious metals.\n\nLaunch your trusted online jewelry boutique with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Sabrianna](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(812,'## Digitizing Nepal\'s Heritage Jewelers\n\nGold and silver (Sun-Chandi) hold profound cultural, religious, and financial value in Nepali households. From Laxmi Puja Dhanteras silver coins and bridal bridal set ornaments to minimalist 925 sterling silver daily jewelry, demand is shifting toward verified, certified online channels.\n\nSelling precious metals online requires stringent security protocols, daily bullion rate adjustments adhering to the Federation of Nepal Gold and Silver Dealers\' Association (FENEGOSIDA), and tamper-evident fulfillment.\n\n---\n\n### Managing Dynamic Bullion Pricing in Nepal\n\n| Metal Type | Standard Purity | Pricing Basis | Required Customer Certificate |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Fine Gold (Chhapa Mar)** | 24 Karat (99.9% pure) | Live FENEGOSIDA per tola rate + Making Charge | Bureau of Standards Assay Hallmark Certificate |\n| **Tejabi Gold** | 22 Karat (91.6% pure) | Daily tola benchmark rate | Karat Purity Test Card |\n| **Fine Silver Bullion** | 999 Fine Silver | Live per 10g / tola rate | Mint Authenti