 Fermented Toners | Snail Secretion Filtrate, Hyaluronic Acid | Deep cellular hydration & plumping |\n| **Targeted Treatment** | Concentrated Serums & Ampoules | 10% Niacinamide, Retinol, Vitamin C | Hyperpigmentation, acne scars & brightening |\n| **Barrier Repair** | Ceramide Creams & Panthenol Lotions | Ceramides NP, Madecassoside, Squalane | Dryness repair in cold Nepali winter months |\n| **Broad-Spectrum Sunscreen** | Chemical & Mineral SPF 50+ PA++++ | Rice Extract, Probiotics, Zinc Oxide | High-altitude UV protection in Himalayan climates |\n\n---\n\n### Batch Expiry Tracking & FIFO Stock Rotation\n\nCosmetics have strict shelf lives (typically 24 to 36 months unopened, 6 to 12 months after opening). With Sazilo Store\'s Cloud POS and inventory manager:\n- Record manufacturing and expiration dates for every imported batch.\n- Enforce First-In, First-Out (FIFO) stock rotation so older batches are dispatched first.\n- Automate clearance sales for products approaching 6-month expiration windows.\n\nBuild your verified beauty storefront on [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Fleur Kaan](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(814,'## The Explosive Growth of K-Beauty and Skincare in Nepal\n\nThe Nepali skincare market has undergone a massive transformation. Consumers across Kathmandu, Pokhara, Chitwan, and Butwal prioritize authentic Korean skincare (K-Beauty) formulations, sunscreens, hydrating toners, and organic botanical cosmetics.\n\nBecause cosmetic counterfeit copies are rampant on unauthorized marketplaces, building a dedicated, branded storefront on **Sazilo Store** establishes brand legitimacy, ingredient transparency, and recurring monthly customer subscriptions.\n\n---\n\n### Essential Korean Skincare Categories and Active Ingredients\n\n| Skincare Step | Hero Product