tore**, artisan guilds, woodcarvers, metalsmiths, and pashmina weavers can sell directly to conscious consumers, yoga studios, and the global Nepali diaspora across the USA, UK, Australia, and Europe.\n\n---\n\n### Authentic Handicraft Classifications and Export Standards\n\n| Craft Category | Production Hub | Materials & Techniques | Export Documentation Needed |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Chyangra Pashmina** | Kathmandu Looms | 100% Cashmere wool from Mountain Goats | Chyangra Pashmina Trademark Certification |\n| **Hand-Beaten Singing Bowls** | Patan (Lalitpur) | 7-Metal Alloy (Copper, Tin, Zinc, Iron, Silver, Gold, Lead) | Handicrafts Association of Nepal (HAN) Certificate |\n| **Traditional Thangka Scrolls** | Bouddha / Bhaktapur | Mineral pigments on treated cotton with 24K gold dust | Department of Archaeology clearance certificate |\n| **Carved Wooden Crafts** | Bhaktapur | Teak, Sal & Rosewood intricate lattice windows (Aki Jhyal) | Quarantine & Non-endangered Wood Declaration |\n\n---\n\n### International Logistics and Multi-Currency Display\n\n1. **Global Currencies**: Display prices in USD, EUR, AUD, GBP, or NPR based on the visitor\'s location.\n2. **DHL / FedEx / Aramex Integration**: Generate export-ready commercial invoices with correct HS codes (Harmonized System codes) for smooth customs clearance.\n3. **Storytelling Rich Media**: Embed high-definition video of the artisan weaving the loom or painting intricate mandala deity eyes to substantiate premium pricing.\n\nExport authentic Nepali craftsmanship with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Sylwia Bartyzel](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(816,'## Taking Nepal\'s Master Artisans to the Global Stage\n\nFrom the historic alleyways of Bhaktapur Pottery Square and Bouddha Thangka studios to Thamel\'s 