zilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(817,'## The Booming Online Bakery & Pastry Sector in Kathmandu Valley\n\nCelebrations, birthdays, anniversaries, and corporate milestones in Kathmandu, Lalitpur, and Bhaktapur are increasingly ordered online. Modern consumers prefer artisanal sourdough loaves, French macarons, bento cakes, and multi-tier fondant celebration cakes delivered directly to celebration venues.\n\nManaging a digital bakery requires precise scheduling, customized cake text annotations, eggless/sugar-free flavor filters, and specialized two-wheeler delivery cake boxes.\n\n---\n\n### Customization Architecture for Cake Ordering\n\n| Cake Tier | Standard Weights | Flavor Options | Required Notice Time |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Trendy Bento Cakes** | 250g – 350g | Chocolate Fudge, Vanilla Berry, Red Velvet | 3–6 Hours Same Day |\n| **Standard Birthday Cakes** | 1 Pound – 2 Pounds | Black Forest, Butterscotch, Belgian Truffle | Same Day (Order by 12 PM) |\n| **Custom 3D Fondant / Theme** | 3 Pounds – 8 Pounds | Premium Hazelnut, Blueberry Cream, Lotus Biscoff | 24–48 Hours Advance Booking |\n| **Artisanal Sourdough & Breads** | 500g Loaf | 100% Whole Wheat, Multigrain, Rye | Baked Fresh Daily (Morning Dispatch) |\n\n---\n\n### Sazilo Store Features for Confectionery and Bakeries\n\n1. **Delivery Date & Time Slot Picker**: Allow customers to choose exact delivery windows (e.g., 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM or 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM).\n2. **Piped Message Field**: Add a mandatory input field at checkout for custom cake inscriptions (e.g., \'Happy 25th Birthday Aayush!\').\n3. **Eggless / Vegan / Sugar-Free Toggles**: Clear badges reassure health-conscious and vegetarian shoppers.\n4. **Counter Cloud POS**: Ring up takeaway croissants and coffee with barcode scanning and instant thermal receipt printing.\n\nLaunch your digital bakery with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: P