ur digital bakery with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Roman Kraft](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(819,'## The Digital Transformation of Community Pharmacies in Nepal\n\nAccess to vital chronic medications (hypertension, diabetes, thyroid management) is essential for elderly and busy citizens across Nepal. Traditional brick-and-mortar pharmacies face intense counter queues, manual paper ledger records, and risk of expired stock write-offs.\n\nBy adopting a compliant digital store on **Sazilo Store**, registered pharmacies can offer regular monthly prescription refills, over-the-counter (OTC) wellness essentials, surgical supplies, and baby healthcare products delivered safely to patient doorsteps.\n\n---\n\n### Regulatory Compliance & Medicine Classification in Nepal\n\n| Classification | Examples | Sale Requirement in Nepal | Delivery Protocol |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Over-the-Counter (OTC)** | Paracetamol, Antacids, Multivitamins, Bandages | Open sale without prescription | Standard courier delivery |\n| **Schedule \'G\' & \'H\' Drugs** | Antibiotics, Antihypertensives, Insulin | Mandatory Doctor\'s Prescription Verification | Pharmacist review before dispatch |\n| **Surgical & Medical Devices** | Blood Glucose Monitors, BP Monitors, Pulse Oximeters | Open sale with warranty registration | Secure shockproof packaging |\n| **Narcotics / Schedule \'Ka\'** | Restricted Opioids & Sedatives | Strict physical register only | Never sold or delivered online |\n\n---\n\n### Essential Tech Stack for Online Pharmacies on Sazilo Store\n\n1. **Prescription Upload Gateway**: Customers can photograph their doctor\'s prescription directly from their smartphone and attach it to their order.\n2. **Batch Number & FIFO Expiry Management**: Track batch numbers from pharmaceutical distributors (Nepal Pharmaceuticals, Deurali-Janta, Asian Pharma, Cipla) and receive automated alerts 90 days before expiration.\n3. **Fast Counter Search (F2 Shortcut)**: Pharmacists can instantly search generic drug molecules (e.g., search *Paracetamol* to view all available brand names and strip counts).\n\nModernize your pharmacy with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Laurynas Mereckas](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(820,'## The Digital Transformation of Community Pharmacies in Nepal\n\nAccess to vital chronic medications (hypertension, diabetes, thyroid management) is essential for elderly and busy citizens across Nepal. Traditional brick-and-mortar pharmacies face intense counter queues, manual paper ledger records, and risk of expired stock write-offs.\n\nBy adopting a compliant digital store on **Sazilo Store**, registered pharmacies can offer regular monthly prescription refills, over-the-counter (OTC) wellness essentials, surgical supplies, and baby healthcare products delivered safely to patient doorsteps.\n\n---\n\n### Regulatory Compliance & Medicine Classification in Nepal\n\n| Classification | Examples | Sale Requirement in Nepal | Delivery Protocol |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Over-the-Counter (OTC)** | Paracetamol, Antacids, Multivitamins, Bandages | Open sale without prescription | Standard courier delivery |\n| **Schedule \'G\' & \'H\' Drugs** | Antibiotics, Antihypertensives, Insulin | Mandatory Doctor\'s Prescription Verification | Pharmacist review before dispatch |\n| **Surgical & Medical Devices** | Blood Glucose Monitors, BP Monitors, Pulse Oximeters | Open sale with warranty registration | Secure shockproof packaging |\n| **Narcotics / Schedule \'Ka\'** | Restricted Opioids & Sedatives | Strict physical register only | Never sold or