cription Alerts**: Enable reorder reminders for regular monthly diaper and water-wipe replenishments.\n\nStart your trusted baby & kids boutique with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Ksenia Chernaya](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(830,'## The Booming Baby Care & Maternity Market in Nepal\n\nNew parents and extended families in Nepal invest heavily in their children\'s comfort, hygiene, and cultural milestones like the **Nwaran** (naming ceremony) and **Pasni** (rice feeding ceremony). From hypoallergenic baby skincare and 100% organic cotton rompers to ergonomic strollers and maternity hospital bags, demand is soaring.\n\nParents value convenience above all else—navigating crowded street markets with an infant is exhausting. A smooth, mobile-optimized **Sazilo Store** storefront delivers essentials straight to the nursery.\n\n---\n\n### Core Baby Product Classifications and Age Filters\n\n| Age Bracket / Milestone | Essential Product Lines | Key Fabric & Safety Standard |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Newborn (0–3 Months)** | Muslin Swaddles, Kimono Onesies, Mittens & Booties | 100% GOTS Organic Cotton, Tagless Necklines |\n| **Infant (3–12 Months)** | Crawling Rompers, Soft-Sole Shoes, Teething Toys | BPA-Free Food-Grade Silicone, Anti-Slip Soles |\n| **Pasni Special (5–6 Months)** | Traditional Silk Velvet Pasni Sets, Silver Bangles | Soft-Lined Velvet, Zero Metallic Scratch Edges |\n| **Toddler (1–3 Years)** | Playwear, Training Cups, Wooden Montessory Toys | Non-Toxic Water-Based Paints, Lead-Free |\n| **Maternity & Postpartum** | Nursing Bras, Maternity Dresses, Postpartum Belts | Breathable Bamboo Cotton & Elastic Support |\n\n---\n\n### Building High-Converting Baby Gift Bundles on Sazilo Store\n\n1. **Newborn Welcome Hampers**: Combine swaddles, organic wash, ratt