ch |\n\n---\n\n### Value-Added E-Commerce Features on Sazilo Store\n\n1. **Pre-Dispatch Professional Setup Guarantee**: Include a badge stating that every guitar\'s neck relief, truss rod, action height, and intonation are checked by an in-house luthier prior to shipment.\n2. **Audio Sample Embeds**: Embed 30-second clean audio recordings showcasing the instrument\'s authentic tone on the product page.\n3. **Complete Beginner Bundles**: Group an acoustic guitar, padded gig bag, clip-on digital tuner, strap, and 5 plectrums into an irresistible starter deal.\n\nLaunch your online music instrument hub with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Wes Hicks](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(840,'## The Thriving Music and Studio Audio Market in Nepal\n\nMusic is woven into the fabric of Nepali society. From rock bands and acoustic singer-songwriters in Kathmandu and Pokhara to traditional folk musicians playing the **Madal**, **Sarangi**, and **Bansuri**, the demand for quality instruments and home studio audio equipment has exploded.\n\nBudding musicians living outside the capital often struggle to find authentic acoustic guitars, tube amplifiers, MIDI keyboards, studio condenser microphones, and replacement strings without overpaying local resellers.\n\n---\n\n### Core Musical Product Lines & Fragile Dispatch Strategies\n\n| Instrument Category | Top Brands in Nepal | Fragile Vulnerability | Shipping Safety Protocol |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Acoustic & Electric Guitars** | Yamaha, Fender, Ibanez, Mantra | Neck joint stress & humidity warping | De-tune strings 1 octave + rigid foam case inside carton |\n| **Traditional Nepali Madals** | Handcrafted Khair & Chapa Wood | Animal hide skin tension & tuning rings | Padded gig bag + moisture-barrier desiccants |\n| **Studio Aud