hisky** | Glenfiddich, Macallan, Old Durbar, Signature | Moderate (Keep out of direct sunlight) | Inflatable multi-chamber air column sleeve |\n| **Fine Red & White Wines** | Bordeaux, Cabernet Sauvignon, Sauvignon Blanc | High (12°C–18°C temperature control) | Thermal insulated bubble wrapping |\n| **Artisanal Craft Gin & Vodka** | Himalayan Botanical Gin, Ruslan Ultra | Moderate | Corrugated divider carton compartments |\n| **Gift Hampers & Bar Accessories** | Crystal Tumblers, Decanters, Cocktail Shakers | High Glass Fragility | Custom foam inserts inside luxury gift box |\n\n---\n\n### Essential Safety & Compliance Controls on Sazilo Store\n\n1. **Digital 21+ Age Gate**: Enforce an age verification confirmation modal before visitors can browse or purchase restricted beverages.\n2. **Excise Duty Hologram Assurance**: Reassure customers with high-definition photos showing the genuine Department of Internal Revenue excise duty sticker intact on the bottle cap.\n3. **Valley Express 2-Hour Delivery**: Offer rapid refrigerated delivery inside Kathmandu, Lalitpur, and Bhaktapur for evening dinner parties and spontaneous celebrations.\n\nBuild your premium beverage storefront with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Adam Jaime](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referral) (Royalty-free under the Unsplash License)*'),(842,'## Curated Wine, Spirits, and Craft Beverages in Nepal\n\nThe adult beverage market in Nepal has matured significantly. Discerning consumers and corporate gifters in Kathmandu and Pokhara regularly seek fine Scotch single malts, imported vintage wines, domestic craft gins, artisanal rums, and premium craft beers for Dashain, Tihar, New Year celebrations, and corporate hospitality.\n\nOperating an online liquor boutique requires strict adherence to legal age verification guidelines, licensed tax-paid excise stamps, and 