cross Kathmandu, Lalitpur, and Pokhara constantly require custom-printed apparel, graphic hoodies, embroidered polo shirts, ceramic mugs, and branded tote bags for events, onboarding kits, and team uniforms.\n\nTraditional print shops lose dozens of hours exchanging design proofs over WhatsApp and negotiating custom prices. Building a modern online portal on **Sazilo Store** streamlines file uploads, proof approvals, and automated tiered bulk pricing.\n\n---\n\n### Apparel Printing Technologies Compared\n\n| Printing Method | Best Fabric Types | Minimum Order Quantity | Durability & Feel |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Direct-to-Film (DTF)** | 100% Cotton, Poly-Cotton Blends | 1 Piece (No MOQ) | High wash fastness, photo-quality color gradients |\n| **Screen Printing** | 100% Heavyweight Cotton (220+ GSM) | 30+ Pieces | Extremely durable, best cost-efficiency for large batches |\n| **Computerized Embroidery** | Polo Collars, Jackets, Caps, Hoodies | 10+ Pieces | Premium textured 3D luxury corporate feel |\n| **Sublimation Printing** | 100% Polyester / Dri-FIT Sports Jerseys | 5+ Pieces | Zero hand feel, permanent vibrant dye infusion |\n\n---\n\n### Streamlining Corporate Merchandise on Sazilo Store\n\n1. **High-Resolution Artwork Upload**: Let clients upload their high-resolution vector logos (PNG, AI, PDF) directly on the product customization page.\n2. **Tiered Bulk Volume Pricing Table**:\n   - 1 – 10 Pieces: NPR 850 per piece\n   - 11 – 50 Pieces: NPR 650 per piece\n   - 51 – 200 Pieces: NPR 500 per piece\n   - 200+ Pieces: NPR 420 per piece\n3. **Automated VAT Invoice Generation**: Instantly generate corporate tax invoices populated with the company\'s registered PAN/VAT number.\n\nAutomate your custom printing business with [Sazilo Store](https://sazilostore.vritico.com/register).\n\n---\n*Cover Image Credit: Photo by [Alexander Andrews](https://unsplash.com/photos/G3s4d_r7Pno) on [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com?utm_source=sazilostore&utm_medium=referra